This is a placeholder for the ORDERS.ID PWA icon.

In a production environment, replace this with an actual PNG image file.

Icon requirements:
- Square dimensions
- PNG format with transparency
- Clear and recognizable at smaller sizes
- Follows brand guidelines

The following sizes are required for PWA compatibility:
- 72x72
- 96x96
- 128x128
- 144x144
- 152x152
- 192x192
- 384x384
- 512x512

Additional icon files needed:
- favicon.ico (16x16, 32x32)
- apple-touch-icon.png (180x180)
- favicon-16x16.png and favicon-32x32.png

For shortcut icons:
- services-96x96.png
- portfolio-96x96.png
- contact-96x96.png

Please refer to the /FAVICON-SETUP.md and /public/icons/README.md for more detailed information.

ORDERS.ID Brand Colors:
- Primary Blue: #3b82f6
- Dark Blue: #1e40af
- Light Blue: #93c5fd
- Dark Background: #111827
- Light Background: #ffffff